# PubNub Platform

> Global infrastructure for real-time, interactive applications, in production since 2012. You build the application; PubNub runs the infrastructure underneath it: pub/sub messaging, presence, data storage, serverless logic, and access control. Backed by a 99.999% uptime SLA, with unlimited subscribers per channel. Inside a region, PubNub adds under 0.5 ms of processing overhead (from ingestion until a message is ready for delivery, excluding network transit); end-to-end delivery latency, publisher to subscriber including network transit, averages about 58 ms.

Every page listed below is also available as Markdown at the URL shown (append `.md` to any pubnub.com page). This file is a curated selection. When it does not list the page you need, use the full index at [llms-full.txt](https://www.pubnub.com/llms-full.txt) (about 200 KB). Current SDK versions and install commands live in the [SDK index](https://www.pubnub.com/docs/sdks.md); this file intentionally does not pin versions.

